==Dimensions==
There are dimensions that exists outside of [[World|Free Realms]].

*[[Abyss]]: A dimension that was mentioned in the [[Free Realms Issue 12]] where [[Darkthorne]] send the [[Shapeshifter]] to the Abyss where she will rot for all eternity. However, it's not in the game.
*[[Cloud World]]: A dimension that is above the Realms. It is also a minigame.
*[[Underworld]]: A dimension where the [[Pumpkin Prince]] was mentioned to be in there. However, it was never planned to be added.

